  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Ezekiel 4",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou also, son of man, take thee a tile, and lay it before thee, and portray upon it a city, even Jerusalem: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and lay siege against it, and build forts against it, and cast up a mound against it; set camps also against it, and plant battering rams against it round about. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And take thou unto thee an iron pan, and set it for a wall of iron between thee and the city: and set thy face toward it, and it shall be besieged, and thou shalt lay siege against it. This shall be a sign to the house of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover lie thou upon thy left side, and lay the iniquity of the house of Israel upon it; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the number of the days that thou shalt lie upon it, thou shalt bear their iniquity. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I have appointed the years of their iniquity to be unto thee a number of days, even three hundred and ninety days: so shalt thou bear the iniquity of the house of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And again, when thou hast accomplished these, thou shalt lie on thy right side, and shalt bear the iniquity of the house of Judah: forty days, each day for a year, have I appointed it unto thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt set thy face toward the siege of Jerusalem, with thine arm uncovered; and thou shalt prophesy against it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And, behold, I lay bands upon thee, and thou shalt not turn thee from one side to the other, till thou hast accomplished the days of thy siege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take thou also unto thee wheat, and barley, and beans, and lentils, and millet, and spelt, and put them in one vessel, and make thee bread thereof; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the number of the days that thou shalt lie upon thy side, even three hundred and ninety days, shalt thou eat thereof. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thy food which thou shalt eat shall be by weight, twenty shekels a day: from time to time shalt thou eat it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt drink water by measure, the sixth part of a hin: from time to time shalt thou drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt eat it as barley cakes, and thou shalt bake it in their sight with dung that cometh out of man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah said, Even thus shall the children of Israel eat their bread unclean, among the nations whither I will drive them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said I, Ah Lord Jehovah! behold, my soul hath not been polluted; for from my youth up even till now have I not eaten of that which dieth of itself, or is torn of beasts; neither came there abominable flesh into my mouth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said unto me, See, I have given thee cow’s dung for man’s dung, and thou shalt prepare thy bread thereon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover he said unto me, Son of man, behold, I will break the staff of bread in Jerusalem: and they shall eat bread by weight, and with fearfulness; and they shall drink water by measure, and in dismay: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that they may want bread and water, and be dismayed one with another, and pine away in their iniquity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
